10
00:57:20,000 --> 00:57:26,000
Secondary liability, or indirect infringement, arises when a party materially contributes to, facilitates,
induces, or is otherwise responsible for directly infringing acts carried out by another party.

11
01:03:04,000 --> 01:03:10,000
The US has statutorily codified secondary liability rules for trademarks and patents, but for
matters relating to copyright, this has solely been a product of case law developments.

12
01:08:48,000 --> 01:08:54,000
In other words, courts, rather than Congress, have been the primary
developers of theories and policies concerning secondary liability.

13
01:14:32,000 --> 01:14:38,000
The film explores themes of hitman, road trip, revenge, sex trafficking.

14
01:20:16,000 --> 01:20:22,000
The tone is lighthearted and intense.
